{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving through a dark road and heading to the event of the year... To the Halloween party that your friends have prepared in a macabre farmhouse far from the city, which has a strange legend behind it tainted by sadness and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While you are enjoying the party, someone is watching you from afar...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, a ramshackle farm, sinister cornfields, dark barns... A horror story in the classic style of the 90's Slasher movies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.poster.avif?t=1757606402\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.webm?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.mp4?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark and gloomy levels with a unique detail and care for details of @TonyDevGame,  (I love detailing the games friends!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.poster.avif?t=1757606402\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.webm?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/ae1b11bbea184a6fb765047a4903bfb6.mp4?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bored of walking simulators? No problem, here you will have to run for your life, and you will also be able to face your enemies!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.poster.avif?t=1757606402\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.webm?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/86f3e9a4dc06f8cf0fe2f74daa4a5559.mp4?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a great time at the party with your buddies! Have a beer, dance a little, talk to your friends, throw a few firecrackers.... Enjoy before it's too late!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.poster.avif?t=1757606402\" width=640 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.webm?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/cf6fe1ef9662140842afd62f1636e98d.mp4?t=1757606402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The game has an autosave system and some gore scenes.</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819310?t=1757606402","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819310?t=1757606402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/0fa9565eae721e03511c3080fe2506107782d11a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757606402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/0fa9565eae721e03511c3080fe2506107782d11a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757606402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains a few violent scenes and gore like slasher movies."},"demos":[{"appid":3861780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's nighttime, you're driving through a dark road and heading to the event of the year... To the Halloween party that your friends have prepared in a macabre farmhouse far from the city, which has a strange legend behind it tainted by sadness and despair. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While you are enjoying the party, someone is watching you from afar...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A silent gas station in the middle of the woods, a ramshackle farm, sinister cornfields, dark barns... A horror story in the classic style of the 90's Slasher movies!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819310/extras/1642f86e0623698d637db41b70bce5f8.poster.avif?t=175760